## State Management

### Tracking "once" content panels

Content panels with `"once": true` are tracked in `state.contentShown`:

```javascript
// In engine state
state.contentShown = {
  "intro-briefing": true,
  "room-1-desc": true
}
```

Before opening:
```javascript
if (contentDef.once && state.contentShown[contentId]) {
  return; // Already shown, skip
}
```

After closing:
```javascript
if (contentDef.once) {
  state.contentShown[contentId] = true;
  this._saveState();
}
```

